From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] transaction(v2): integrate native transaction identities and
 serialization

Integrate native V7 transaction identities and serialization with the bounded
stack fast path for InitHashes and Mode-0 witness verification. Introduce
the final moving conversions and hash buffers directly, avoiding an
intermediate implementation that a later patch replaces.

Original patch rationale (describes the unsplit source, not every extracted part):
Add libFuzzer harnesses covering V2 v7 wire codecs, Lotus V2 VM execution,
Merklix set reconciliation, and UTXO shard fast sync.

